<div class="item"><span class="jp">ウケる</span><span class="romaji">ukeru</span><span class="reg reg-casual">○ casual</span><span class="meaning">trop drôle / j'suis mort (rire) <span class="note">revu (L49 めっちゃウケる)</span></span><span class="poli">poli : 面白いです</span><span class="dial">A: 駅（えき）で転（ころ）んだ。
